  "description": "Big travel equals big descents and the Auric lets you shred the downhill. Thanks to the 160mm of MLink™ suspension you won't be dragging on the climbs either. Up or down the Auric is the bike for your big days on the mountain. A6-SL super-butted alloy frame is lightweight and strong. 160mm of MLink™ rear suspension and a 160mm travel fork provide the platform for a superior climbing and descending mountain bike Boost 148x12 rear and Boost 110x15 front hub spacing stiffens the Auric's chassis. Internal cable routing provides clean aesthetics and protects cables from dirt and debris for consistent shifting and reduced service intervals. Stealth or external dropper seatpost compatible 27.5\" wheels keep the wheelbase in check while providing good roll over capability on rough trails",
